From: "Anthony Fu (via agent)" <reg-github-bot@antfu.me>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:50:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(server): fall back to the GitHub owner's avatar for
 project icons

A project with no icon file showed only its initial. For a project whose
origin is on GitHub, the daemon now uses the owner's avatar
(github.com/<owner>.png, so nuxt/devtools gets github.com/nuxt.png) when the
local search finds nothing. A custom icon and any local icon still win.

Avatars are fetched with a 3 s timeout and cached per owner in memory: a day
for a found or missing owner, ten minutes after a failure. Offline daemons
keep the initial.

